[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3439621278","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111973#issuecomment-3439621278","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111973","id":3439621278,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7NBHSe","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-23T23:02:04Z","updated_at":"2025-10-23T23:48:42Z","body":"GeForce 8/9 GPUs aren't going to work well in Godot 4, as they're too old at this point ([introduced in 2006](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/GeForce_8_series)). Their OpenGL support is too limited for modern applications, even those sticking to OpenGL 3.3. This already proved problematic in Godot 3.x when using GLES3.\n\nHowever, there are reports where GeForce 8/9 GPUs were used on Windows with Compatibility, with varying degrees of success: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/97671\n\nYou could try to run Godot with llvmpipe for software rendering (`--rendering-driver vulkan --gpu-index 1`), but it's going to be very slow. Alternatively, [Godot 3.6](https://godotengine.org/download/3.x/linux/) should still work acceptably when using GLES2 (which only uses OpenGL 2.1 on desktop platforms).\n\nFixing issues is going to be very difficult here, since I doubt any of the rendering contributors have access to this GPU. We should probably print an error on startup then abort on such old GPUs, or at least print a warning before continuing further (as it'll likely crash later on).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3439621278/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3446879190","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111973#issuecomment-3446879190","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111973","id":3446879190,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7NczPW","user":{"login":"La5r","id":207784964,"node_id":"U_kgDODGKMBA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/207784964?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/La5r","html_url":"https://github.com/La5r","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/La5r/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/La5r/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/La5r/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/La5r/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/La5r/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/La5r/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/La5r/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/La5r/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/La5r/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-25T16:24:39Z","updated_at":"2025-10-25T21:27:00Z","body":"Buy Another computer","author_association":"NONE",